 "remarks": "Chic industrial NYC-style loft. Just 7-minutes from bustling downtown South Norwalk, this centrally-located building is bursting with amenities that include a parking garage, newly renovated gym, conference room and communal picnic space. Inside the loft, you're welcomed with new flooring, warm natural lighting and a stunning brick feature wall that adds to the character-filled finishes throughout. The open concept entertainment space is perfect for hosting friends and family, beginning with the beautiful kitchen and 2 story window pouring in natural light. Just off the living room sits a charming home office, one of only two units in the building that offer this space, perfect for working from home. A newly updated half-bath is just off the kitchen. The lofted bedroom is spacious and private with luxury vinyl flooring throughout. Closet organization system make the most of space, and the chic bathroom has been updated with new lighting, flooring, and additional cabinetry added for extra storage. All appointments must be confirmed. 2 Months security deposit, reference checks, & excellent credit. Agent owner.",
